@startuml SEQ_03_MELIHAT_CATATAN_KAS
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-03: Melihat Catatan Kas

actor       "Admin / Asisten"           as Viewer
boundary    "Browser"                   as Browser
control     "RiwayatKeuanganController" as Controller
entity      "RiwayatKeuangan Model"     as Model
entity      "NominalKas Model"          as ModelKas
entity      "User Model"                as ModelUser

== Lihat Catatan Kas ==

Viewer  -> Browser      : Buka menu catatan kas

Browser -> Controller   : GET /catatan-kas

Controller -> Model     : Query transaksi kas masuk
Model --> Controller : Hasil query
Controller -> ModelUser : Query anggota
ModelUser --> Controller : Hasil query
Controller -> ModelKas  : Query nominal kas
ModelKas --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser  : Render halaman
Browser --> Viewer      : Tampil matriks kas

@enduml